14 - to update the time zone configuration in PHP write 
sudo sed -i "2i date.timezone = \"America/New_York\" " /etc/php.ini
sudo service httpd restart
the first command configures the time zone in PHP SW 
the second command restart the web server to update the configuration 
15 - to open the cafe website write 
